<p>Using a huge amount of steam, you temporarily supercharge your tinkers and other steam-powered talents.</p><p>For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25, 30, 35, 40, 45</acronym> steampower and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 9%, 13%, 16%, 20%</acronym> steamtech critical chance.</p>